{{!
    @template tool_lp/course_competencies_page

    A course's competencies, for the teacher and for the learner, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/course_competencies_page of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/course_competencies_page.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on every core upgrade.

    It renders from core's context alone: that is what tool_lp/competencies and tool_lp/course_competency_settings
    hand it on the client after adding or removing a competency, changing a course outcome or the ratings setting,
    when they replace the region whole (templates.replaceNode or replaceWith with runTemplateJS) and run this
    template's js block again. Reordering moves the rows in place and renders nothing. The theme's first paint adds
    keys of its own (dimfirstpaint, per competency dimextra, per listed activity dimcm, from
    theme_dimensions\local\competency\coursecompetencies); theme_dimensions/coursecompetencies, started from the js
    block, puts them back after each re-render from theme_dimensions_get_course_competency_extras.

    Kept from core: the root data-region="coursecompetenciespage" (replaced whole); both data-region="actions"
    with the "Add competencies to course" button under canmanagecoursecompetencies, disabled until
    tool_lp/competencies enables it; data-region="configurecoursecompetencies" with core's two sentences under
    cangradecompetencies and the data-action="configure-course-competency-settings" link with data-courseid and
    data-pushratingstouserplans under canconfigurecoursecompetencies; the statistics partial; data-region
    "coursecompetencies" with the table.managecompetencies, the tbody.drag-parentnode, one tr.drag-samenode per
    competency with data-id, the span.drag-handlecontainer and the delete link (data-action
    "delete-competency-link", data-id) under canmanagecoursecompetencies; the link titled "View details" with the
    id competency-info-link-<id> (the statistics' anchors) to user_competency_in_course.php, the shortname
    triple-stashed and the description a p directly in the cell (tool_lp's named selectors); the path partial;
    the learner's rating as a span.badge with core's gradename; data-region="coursecompetency-ruleoutcome" with
    the label wrapping select[data-field="ruleoutcome"][data-id] and core's options; the activities and the
    learning plans regions and their empty strings; the empty course or activity message; the manage link; both
    js blocks.
    Changed: the classes are the theme's (scss/competency.scss); the rating is a status label with an icon per
    proficiency where core used bg-success and bg-danger; the "Add" button is primary; the ratings setting is a
    callout; each section has a small heading and its list is a plain list, where core put a ul inside a p (which
    HTML does not allow); the activity icon has an empty alt; the empty message is a compact line. Added: per
    listed activity a data-region="dim-comp-cm" keyed by data-cmid (its outcome, and the learner's state), per
    competency a data-region="dim-comp-extra" keyed by data-competencyid (the class distribution for a viewer who may see the whole class, the
    learner's evidence), and theme_dimensions/coursecompetencies in the js block. Neither carries data-id: core
    reads the delete link's id through closest('[data-id]').

    Context variables required for this template:
    * courseid, moduleid, pagecontextid, pluginbaseurl, gradableuserid
    * canmanagecoursecompetencies, cangradecompetencies, canconfigurecoursecompetencies,
      canmanagecompetencyframeworks, manageurl
    * settings - pushratingstouserplans
    * statistics - see the statistics partial
    * competencies - competency, coursecompetency, ruleoutcomeoptions, coursemodules, comppath, plans,
      usercompetencycourse

    Example context (json):
    {
        "courseid": 2,
        "moduleid": 0,
        "pagecontextid": 20,
        "pluginbaseurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp",
        "gradableuserid": 3,
        "canmanagecoursecompetencies": true,
        "cangradecompetencies": true,
        "canconfigurecoursecompetencies": true,
        "canmanagecompetencyframeworks": true,
        "manageurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp/competencyframeworks.php?pagecontextid=1",
        "settings": {
            "pushratingstouserplans": true
        },
        "dimfirstpaint": true,
        "competencies": [{
            "competency": {
                "id": 7,
                "shortname": "Assessment strategies",
                "idnumber": "DIG-4.1",
                "description": "Uses digital technologies for formative and summative assessment."
            },
            "coursecompetency": {
                "id": 1
            },
            "ruleoutcomeoptions": [{
                "value": "0",
                "text": "Do nothing",
                "selected": false
            }, {
                "value": "1",
                "text": "Attach evidence",
                "selected": true
            }],
            "usercompetencycourse": {
                "grade": 2,
                "gradename": "Competent",
                "proficiency": true
            },
            "coursemodules": [{
                "id": 31,
                "name": "Digital rubrics workshop",
                "url": "https://example.com/mod/assign/view.php?id=31",
                "iconurl": "https://example.com/theme/image.php/dimensions/assign/1/monologo",
                "dimcm": {
                    "cmid": 31,
                    "outcome": 1,
                    "outcomename": "Attach evidence",
                    "outcometone": "rated",
                    "hasstate": true,
                    "isdone": true,
                    "istodo": false,
                    "statetext": "Completed on 2 October 2026"
                }
            }],
            "plans": [{
                "id": 4,
                "name": "Digital teaching"
            }],
            "dimextra": {
                "competencyid": 7,
                "hasdistribution": true,
                "haslearners": true,
                "progresstextvalue": "14 of 24 proficient",
                "percentagevalue": 58,
                "percentlabelvalue": "58%",
                "ratedtext": "7 rated, not proficient",
                "notratedtext": "3 not rated",
                "haslearner": true,
                "evidencetext": "2 pieces of evidence from this course, the latest on 18 October 2026"
            }
        }]
    }
}}
<div data-region="coursecompetenciespage" class="dim-comp-course"{{#dimfirstpaint}} data-dim-extras="1"{{/dimfirstpaint}}>
    <div data-region="actions" class="clearfix dim-comp-course-actions">
        <div class="float-sm-start">
            {{#canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
                <button class="btn btn-primary" disabled>{{#str}}addcoursecompetencies, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>
            {{/canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div data-region="configurecoursecompetencies">
    {{#cangradecompetencies}}
        <p class="dim-comp-callout dim-comp-course-push">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info dim-comp-callout__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span>
            {{#settings.pushratingstouserplans}}
                {{#str}}coursecompetencyratingsarepushedtouserplans, tool_lp{{/str}}
            {{/settings.pushratingstouserplans}}
            {{^settings.pushratingstouserplans}}
                {{#str}}coursecompetencyratingsarenotpushedtouserplans, tool_lp{{/str}}
            {{/settings.pushratingstouserplans}}
            </span>
        {{#canconfigurecoursecompetencies}}
            <a href="#"
               data-action="configure-course-competency-settings"
               data-courseid="{{courseid}}"
               data-pushratingstouserplans="{{settings.pushratingstouserplans}}">
                {{#pix}}i/settings, core, {{#str}}edit{{/str}}{{/pix}}
            </a>
        {{/canconfigurecoursecompetencies}}
        </p>
    {{/cangradecompetencies}}
    </div>
{{#statistics}}
{{> tool_lp/course_competency_statistics }}
{{/statistics}}
<div data-region="coursecompetencies">
<table class="table generaltable fullwidth managecompetencies dim-comp-course-table">
<tbody class="drag-parentnode">
{{#competencies}}
    <tr class="drag-samenode" data-id="{{competency.id}}">
    <td class="dim-comp-course-cell">
        {{#canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
        <span class="drag-handlecontainer float-sm-start"></span>
        <div class="float-sm-end">
            <a href="#" data-action="delete-competency-link" data-id="{{competency.id}}">
                {{#pix}}t/delete, core, {{#str}}delete{{/str}}{{/pix}}
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="clearfix"></div>
        {{/canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
        {{#competency}}
        <h3 class="dim-comp-course-name">
            <a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/user_competency_in_course.php?courseid={{courseid}}&amp;competencyid={{competency.id}}&amp;userid={{gradableuserid}}"
                   id="competency-info-link-{{competency.id}}"
                   title="{{#str}}viewdetails, tool_lp{{/str}}">{{{competency.shortname}}} <em class="dim-comp-idnumber">{{competency.idnumber}}</em></a>
        </h3>
        <p class="dim-comp-course-description">{{{competency.description}}}</p>
        {{/competency}}
        {{#comppath}}
        <div class="dim-comp-section dim-comp-course-path">
            <span class="float-sm-start">{{#str}}path, tool_lp{{/str}}&nbsp;</span>{{> tool_lp/competency_path }}
        </div>
        {{/comppath}}
        {{#usercompetencycourse}}
            {{#grade}}
            <div class="dim-comp-pills dim-comp-course-rating">
                {{#proficiency}}
                <span class="badge dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--proficient">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{gradename}}
                </span>
                {{/proficiency}}
                {{^proficiency}}
                <span class="badge dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notproficient">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{gradename}}
                </span>
                {{/proficiency}}
            </div>
            {{/grade}}
        {{/usercompetencycourse}}
        {{#canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
        <div data-region="coursecompetency-ruleoutcome" class="dim-comp-course-outcome">
            <label>
                {{#str}}uponcoursecompletion, tool_lp{{/str}}
                <select data-field="ruleoutcome" data-id="{{coursecompetency.id}}" class="form-select">
                  {{#ruleoutcomeoptions}}
                     <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{text}}</option>
                  {{/ruleoutcomeoptions}}
                </select>
            </label>
        </div>
        {{/canmanagecoursecompetencies}}
        <div data-region="coursecompetencyactivities" class="dim-comp-section">
            <h4 class="dim-comp-eyebrow">{{#str}}activities{{/str}}</h4>
            <ul class="dim-comp-course-cms">
            {{#coursemodules}}
                <li class="dim-comp-course-cmrow">
                    <a href="{{url}}"><img class="icon" src="{{iconurl}}" alt=""> {{name}} </a>
                    <span data-region="dim-comp-cm" data-cmid="{{id}}">{{#dimcm}}{{> theme_dimensions/competency_course_cm }}{{/dimcm}}</span>
                </li>
            {{/coursemodules}}
            {{^coursemodules}}
                <li class="dim-comp-course-cmrow dim-comp-muted">{{#str}}noactivities, tool_lp{{/str}}</li>
            {{/coursemodules}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-region="learningplans" class="dim-comp-section">
            <h4 class="dim-comp-eyebrow">{{#str}}userplans, core_competency{{/str}}</h4>
            <ul class="dim-comp-course-plans">
            {{#plans}}
                <li><a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/plan.php?id={{id}}">{{{name}}}</a></li>
            {{/plans}}
            {{^plans}}
                <li class="dim-comp-muted">{{#str}}nouserplanswithcompetency, core_competency{{/str}}</li>
            {{/plans}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-region="dim-comp-extra" data-competencyid="{{competency.id}}" class="dim-comp-course-extraslot">{{#dimextra}}{{> theme_dimensions/competency_course_extra }}{{/dimextra}}</div>
    </td>
    </tr>
{{/competencies}}
</tbody>
</table>
{{^competencies}}
<p class="dim-comp-course-empty">
    {{#moduleid}}
        {{#str}}nocompetenciesinactivity, tool_lp{{/str}}
    {{/moduleid}}
    {{^moduleid}}
        {{#str}}nocompetenciesincourse, tool_lp{{/str}}
    {{/moduleid}}
</p>
{{/competencies}}
</div>
<div data-region="actions">
    {{#canmanagecompetencyframeworks}}
        <p><a href="{{manageurl}}">{{#str}}managecompetenciesandframeworks, tool_lp{{/str}}</a></p>
    {{/canmanagecompetencyframeworks}}
</div>
</div>
{{#js}}
require(['tool_lp/competencies'], function(Mod) {
    (new Mod({{courseid}}, 'course', {{pagecontextid}}));
});
require(['theme_dimensions/coursecompetencies'], function(Extras) {
    Extras.init({{courseid}});
});
{{/js}}
{{#canconfigurecoursecompetencies}}
{{#js}}
require(['tool_lp/course_competency_settings'], function(Mod) {
    (new Mod('[data-action=configure-course-competency-settings]'));
});
{{/js}}
{{/canconfigurecoursecompetencies}}
